es through The Catch.","notes":"university arc of Kvothe's narrated past.","createdAt":1785115320805,"updatedAt":1785115320805,"wordGoal":null},{"id":"wmf-chapter-45","worldId":"ag5-SfCGAP0HIVKimJBe7","timelineId":"wmf-timeline-kvothe-story","number":45,"title":"Consortation","synopsis":"At the University and in Imre, Kvothe advances his studies and rivalries through Consortation.","notes":"university arc of Kvothe's narrated past.","createdAt":1785115320805,"updatedAt":1785115320805,"wordGoal":null},{"id":"wmf-chapter-46","worldId":"ag5-SfCGAP0HIVKimJBe7","timelineId":"wmf-timeline-waystone","number":46,"title":"Interlude—A Bit of Fiddle","synopsis":"Kote pauses the account, and music briefly exposes the man beneath the innkeeper.","notes":"Frame narrative at the Waystone Inn.","createdAt":1785115320805,"updatedAt":1785115320805,"wordGoal":null},{"id":"wmf-chapter-47","worldId":"ag5-SfCGAP0HIVKimJBe7","timelineId":"wmf-timeline-waystone","number":47,"title":"Interlude—The Hempen Verse","synopsis":"Bast and Chronicler manage another interruption in the Waystone's tense second day.","notes":"Frame narrative at the Waystone Inn.","createdAt":1785115320805,"updatedAt":1785115320805,"wordGoal":null},{"id":"wmf-chapter-48","worldId":"ag5-SfCGAP0HIVKimJBe7","timelineId":"wmf-timeline-kvothe-story","number":48,"title":"A Significant Absence","synopsis":"Kvothe prepares to leave the University, settling obligations while Denna remains absent.","notes":"university arc of Kvothe's narrated past.","createdAt":1785115320805,"updatedAt":1785115320805,"wordGoal":null},{"id":"wmf-chapter-49","worldId":"ag5-SfCGAP0HIVKimJBe7","timelineId":"wmf-timeline-kvothe-story","number":49,"title":"The Ignorant Edema","synopsis":"Threpe equips Kvothe with letters and advice for the dangerous journey to Vintas.","notes":"university arc of Kvothe's narrated past.","createdAt":1785115320805,"updatedAt":1785115320805,"wordGoal":null},{"id":"wmf-chapter-50","worldId":"ag5-SfCGAP0HIVKimJBe7","timeli