 11 — The Binding of Iron","body":"Kvothe learns the laws of sympathy and practices bindings that transfer energy between linked objects.\n\n- **The Binding of Iron** — Kvothe learns the laws of sympathy and practices bindings that transfer energy between linked objects.","tags":[],"coverImageId":null,"linkedEntityIds":[],"visibleFromEventId":null,"createdAt":1785115320805,"updatedAt":1785115320816},{"id":"39xUVphxfCNEjAuUPAgLB","worldId":"ag5-SfCGAP0HIVKimJBe7","categoryId":"lpdEp5VVNrfGvl-oQYAd9","title":"Ch. 10 — Alar and the Several Stones","body":"Ben trains Kvothe in Alar, Heart of Stone, and splitting his mind between contradictory beliefs.\n\n- **Alar and the Several Stones** — Ben trains Kvothe in Alar, Heart of Stone, and splitting his mind between contradictory beliefs.","tags":[],"coverImageId":null,"linkedEntityIds":[],"visibleFromEventId":null,"createdAt":1785115320805,"updatedAt":1785115320815},{"id":"3QAmL18rIBYh6LIdOxu9j","worldId":"ag5-SfCGAP0HIVKimJBe7","categoryId":"lpdEp5VVNrfGvl-oQYAd9","title":"Ch. 39 — Enough Rope","body":"Kvothe teaches Hemme's sympathy class and uses the master's permission to demonstrate a painful binding.\n\n- **Enough Rope** — Kvothe teaches Hemme's sympathy class and uses the master's permission to demonstrate a painful binding.\n- **Kvothe Meets Ambrose** — A confrontation outside the Archives begins Kvothe's long rivalry with Ambrose Jakis.","tags":[],"coverImageId":null,"linkedEntityIds":[],"visibleFromEventId":null,"createdAt":1785115320805,"updatedAt":1785115320844},{"id":"3QxoOyKjNzf9c5Mt-0ech","worldId":"ag5-SfCGAP0HIVKimJBe7","categoryId":"lpdEp5VVNrfGvl-oQYAd9","title":"Ch. 32 — Coppers, Cobblers and Crowds","body":"Kvothe joins Roent's caravan on the Great Stone Road toward the University.\n\n- **Coppers, Cobblers and Crowds** — Kvothe joins Roent's caravan on the Great Stone Road toward the University.\n- **Josn's Lute Awakens Kvothe** — Kvothe plays Josn's lute and reconnects with the music and identity grief had buried.","tags":[],"coverImageId":null,"linkedEntityIds":[],"visibleFromEventId":null,"createdAt":1785115320805,"updatedAt":1785115320837},{"id":"3btJIrKpVCcKukQT5I7-0","worldId":"ag5-SfCGAP0HIVKimJBe7","categoryId":"lpdEp5VVNrfGvl-oQYAd9","title":"Ch. 62 — Leaves","body":"After Ambrose drives him from the Horse and Four, Kvothe finds Anker's and walks with Denna for hours.\n\n- **Leaves** — After Ambrose drives him from the Horse and Four, Kvothe finds Anker's and walks with Denna for hours.","tags":[],"coverImageId":null,"linkedEntityIds":[],"visibleFromEventId":null,"createdAt":1785115320805,"updatedAt":1785115320867},{"id":"3vwRZcMDNLbvxQ7b1mHVn","worldId":"ag5-SfCGAP0HIVKimJBe7","categoryId":"lpdEp5VVNrfGvl-oQYAd9","title":"Ch. 15 — Distractions and Farewells","body":"At Hallowfell, Ben leaves the troupe and gives Kvothe Rhetoric and Logic with a warning to beware folly.\n\n- **Distractions and Farewells** — At Hallowfell, Ben leaves the troupe and gives Kvothe Rhetoric and Logic with a warning to beware folly.","tags":[],"coverImageId":null,"linkedEntityIds":[],"visibleFromEventId":null,"createdAt":1785115320805,"updatedAt":1785115320820},{"id":"4ROZHoJnDIiFMsSI1MYXL","worldId":"ag5-SfCGAP0HIVKimJBe7","categoryId":"lpdEp5VVNrfGvl-oQYAd9","title":"Ch. 20 — Bloody Hands Into Stinging Fists","body":"Newly arrived in Tarbean, Kvothe is robbed and beaten by street boys and loses nearly everything.\n\n- **Bloody Hands Into Stinging Fists** — Newly arrived in Tarbean, Kvothe is robbed and beaten by street boys and loses nearly everything.\n- **Pike Robs Kvothe** — Pike and his gang rob and beat Kvothe, reinforcing the brutal rules of Waterside.","tags":[],"coverImageId":null,"linkedEntityIds":[],"visibleFromEventId":null,"createdAt":1785115320805,"updatedAt":1785115320825},{"id":"4fKxhxWcJ4PWM4SdJ09v8","worldId":"ag5-SfCGAP0HIVKimJBe7","categoryId":"lpdEp5VVNrfGvl-oQYAd9","title":"Ch. 14 — The Name of the Wind","body":"Kvothe binds his lungs to the outside air and nearly dies; Ben calls the wind to save him.\n\n- **The Name of the Wind** — Kvothe binds his lungs to the outside air and nearly dies; Ben calls the wind to save him.\n- **Kvothe Calls the Wind** — Kvothe's reckless sympathy binds his breath to the air until Abenthy speaks the wind's name and saves him.","tags":[],"coverImageId":null,"linkedEntityIds":[],"visibleFromEventId":null,"createdAt":1785115320805,"updatedAt":1785115320819},{"id":"4x1BUH2ZEzIYcL93D3ziL","worldId":"ag5-SfCGAP0HIVKimJBe7","categoryId":"lpdEp5VVNrfGvl-oQYAd9","title":"Ch. 93 — Epilogue: A Silence of Three Parts","body":"Night settles over the Waystone while Chronicler lies frightened and Kote's patient silence remains.\n\n- **A Silence of Three Parts** — Night settles over the Waystone while Chronicler lies frightened and Kote's patient silence remains.","tags":[],"coverImageId":null,"linkedEntityIds":[],"visibleFromEventId":null,"createdAt":1785115320805,"updatedAt":1785115320898},{"id":"4zrwDlbf7Ygqv0QW26bNx","worldId":"ag5-SfCGAP0HIVKimJBe7","categoryId":"lpdEp5VVNrfGvl-oQYAd9","title":"Ch. 61 — Jackass, Jackass","body":"Kvothe and Threpe's mocking song about Ambrose spreads, prompting another charge and a venomous apology.\n\n- **Jackass, Jackass** — Kvothe and Threpe's mocking song about Ambrose spreads, prompting another charge and a venomous apology.\n- **Jackass, Jackass** — Kvothe publicly performs a mocking song about Ambrose, worsening their feud.","tags":[],"coverImageId":null,"linkedEntityIds":[],"visibleFromEventId":null,"createdAt":1785115320805,"updatedAt":1785115320866},{"id":"5MudtsApaDIXbxMHuSXje","worldId":"ag5-SfCGAP0HIVKimJBe7","categoryId":"lpdEp5VVNrfGvl-oQYAd9","title":"Ch. 59 — All This Knowing","body":"Kvothe, Wil, and Sim walk home drunk beneath a beautiful night, secure in their friendship.\n\n- **All This Knowing** — Kvothe, Wil, and Sim walk home drunk beneath a beautiful night, secure in their friendship.","tags":[],"coverImageId":null,"linkedEntityIds":[],"