nd expulsion, raise Kvothe to Re'lar, and Elodin explains his sleeping mind named the wind.","tags":[],"coverImageId":null,"linkedEntityIds":[],"visibleFromEventId":null,"createdAt":1785115320805,"updatedAt":1785115320891},{"id":"EzACG60QP0A6QTa3ZbKFa","worldId":"ag5-SfCGAP0HIVKimJBe7","categoryId":"lpdEp5VVNrfGvl-oQYAd9","title":"Ch. 85 — Hands Against Me","body":"Ambrose accuses Kvothe of malfeasance before the masters, who vote on lashes and expulsion.\n\n- **Hands Against Me** — Ambrose accuses Kvothe of malfeasance before the masters, who vote on lashes and expulsion.","tags":[],"coverImageId":null,"linkedEntityIds":[],"visibleFromEventId":null,"createdAt":1785115320805,"updatedAt":1785115320890},{"id":"HvuAF3vWFRdOIkdXq7DVG","worldId":"ag5-SfCGAP0HIVKimJBe7","categoryId":"lpdEp5VVNrfGvl-oQYAd9","title":"Ch. 3 — Wood and Word","body":"Kote mounts the sword Folly, is recognized by a traveler, and quietly prepares to hunt the scrael.\n\n- **Wood and Word** — Kote mounts the sword Folly, is recognized by a traveler, and quietly prepares to hunt the scrael.\n- **The Scrael Ambush** — Kote lures the remaining scrael to a prepared camp and destroys them at severe cost.","tags":[],"coverImageId":null,"linkedEntityIds":[],"visibleFromEventId":null,"createdAt":1785115320805,"updatedAt":1785115320808},{"id":"IU7BUQAB65cmklsrGz8bb","worldId":"ag5-SfCGAP0HIVKimJBe7","categoryId":"2GhN-sKSSsRNXdu234l6O","title":"Naming","body":"Knowing a thing's true name grants direct power over it. The sleeping mind hears names more clearly than the waking mind.","tags":["naming","wind"],"coverImageId":null,"linkedEntityIds":["8BnAzt1AV8Faa_6MDPAIo","yESmakRTZSWXPm8qKw-Ru"],"visibleFromEventId":null,"createdAt":1785115320805,"updatedAt":1785115320805},{"id":"IZyH7yxGlFmmiYk_HmSqu","worldId":"ag5-SfCGAP0HIVKimJBe7","categoryId":"lpdEp5VVNrfGvl-oQYAd9","title":"Ch. 75 — Interlude: Obedience","body":"Kote expects disbelief about the draccus but receives only Chronicler's obedient silence.\n\