 blood.\n\n- **Wind or Women's Fancy** — Hired men attack Kvothe with a dowsing compass; he escapes but knows they carry his blood.\n- **The Alley Assassins** — Two hired men attack Kvothe with a device keyed to his blood; he escapes through sympathy and nerve.","tags":[],"coverImageId":null,"linkedEntityIds":[],"visibleFromEventId":null,"createdAt":1785115320805,"updatedAt":1785115320874},{"id":"KDx852XfHGngp3QOdM6cq","worldId":"ag5-SfCGAP0HIVKimJBe7","categoryId":"9L_3Vt6Mix45Dg0e4y3xi","title":"Scrael","body":"Hard, spiderlike creatures of stone and iron that appear near Newarre in groups.","tags":["scrael","creature"],"coverImageId":null,"linkedEntityIds":["i4DiG-YzX03p18hEJV18g"],"visibleFromEventId":null,"createdAt":1785115320805,"updatedAt":1785115320805},{"id":"Kck1_I53l2URkCu1BD37Y","worldId":"ag5-SfCGAP0HIVKimJBe7","categoryId":"lpdEp5VVNrfGvl-oQYAd9","title":"Ch. 78 — Poison","body":"After Denna tastes denner resin, the pair decide they must poison the creature before it reaches Trebon.\n\n- **Poison** — After Denna tastes denner resin, the pair decide they must poison the creature before it reaches Trebon.\n- **Denna Eats Denner Resin** — Denna consumes the addictive resin, leaving Kvothe to protect her while the draccus grows more dangerous.","tags":[],"coverImageId":null,"linkedEntityIds":[],"visibleFromEventId":null,"createdAt":1785115320805,"updatedAt":1785115320883},{"id":"LkboAWI0aXhZIWF5cLZ-a","worldId":"ag5-SfCGAP0HIVKimJBe7","categoryId":"lpdEp5VVNrfGvl-oQYAd9","title":"Ch. 49 — The Nature of Wild Things","body":"A hostile admissions exam leaves Kvothe owing three talents and searching Imre for a dangerous moneylender.\n\n- **The Nature of Wild Things** — A hostile admissions exam leaves Kvothe owing three talents and searching Imre for a dangerous moneylender.\n- **Kvothe Meets Auri** — In the moonlit Underthing, Kvothe befriends the fragile young woman he names Auri.","tags":[],"coverImageId":null,"linkedEntityIds":[],"visibleFromEventId":null,"createdAt":1785115320805,"updatedAt":1785115320854},{"id":"MVgiUEIGtqqoT1KkZD3q_","worldId":"ag5-SfCGAP0HIVKimJBe7","categoryId":"2GhN-sKSSsRNXdu234l6O","title":"The Archives and the Four-Plate Door","body":"The Archives hold a vast but disordered body of knowledge; a sealed stone door with four copper plates remains unexplained.","tags":["archives","mystery"],"coverImageId":null,"linkedEntityIds":["zPWhlfcrzYQUtjGWYFq1U"],"visibleFromEventId":null,"createdAt":1785115320805,"updatedAt":1785115320805},{"id":"Ni7pMqdTf7gI64cksAupO","worldId":"ag5-SfCGAP0HIVKimJBe7","categoryId":"lpdEp5VVNrfGvl-oQYAd9","title":"Ch. 35 — A Parting of Ways","body":"Kvothe and Denna part at Anilin while he continues toward the University.\n\n- **A Parting of Ways** — Kvothe and Denna part at Anilin while he continues toward the University.","tags":[],"coverImageId":null,"linkedEntityIds":[],"visibleFromEventId":null,"createdAt":1785115320805,"updatedAt":1785115320840},{"id":"P0V39izwffaVPY55AGwPy","worldId":"ag5-SfCGAP0HIVKimJBe7","categoryId":"lpdEp5VVNrfGvl-oQYAd9","title":"Ch. 30 — The Broken Binding","body":"Kvothe sells Ben's inscribed book at the Broken Binding to finance his transformation and journey.\n\n- **The Broken Binding** — Kvothe sells Ben's inscribed book at the Broken Binding to finance his transformation and journey.\n- **Kvothe Joins Roent's Caravan** — Kvothe bargains for passage east with Roent's caravan and begins presenting himself as a gentleman.","tags":[],"coverImageId":null,"linkedEntityIds":[],"visibleFromEventId":null,"createdAt":1785115320805,"updatedAt":1785115320835},{"id":"P15MOBBF2PXqx4LCAEuRs","worldId":"ag5-SfCGAP0HIVKimJBe7","categoryId":"iusifrFL_lfSAAYe7FdIn","title":"The Edema Ruh","body":"Traveling performers who preserve songs, drama, and stories while facing deep prejudice from settled society.","tags":["edema-ruh","culture"],"coverImageId":null,"linkedEntityIds":["yESmakRTZSWXPm8qKw-Ru","sW96USkf3kklEc3noztba"],"visibleFromEventId":null,"crea