Adem name the Chandrian as Rhinta.","createdAt":1785115320805,"updatedAt":1785115320805},{"id":"wmf-thread-ambrose","worldId":"ag5-SfCGAP0HIVKimJBe7","name":"The Rivalry with Ambrose","color":"#dc2626","description":"Ambrose escalates theft, poisoning, legal pressure, and malfeasance against Kvothe.","createdAt":1785115320805,"updatedAt":1785115320805},{"id":"wmf-thread-denna","worldId":"ag5-SfCGAP0HIVKimJBe7","name":"Denna and Master Ash","color":"#db2777","description":"Kvothe's love for Denna collides with her secrecy, patron, and controversial song of Lanre.","createdAt":1785115320805,"updatedAt":1785115320805},{"id":"wmf-thread-maer","worldId":"ag5-SfCGAP0HIVKimJBe7","name":"Service to the Maer","color":"#b45309","description":"Kvothe saves Alveron, arranges his courtship, hunts his bandits, and earns complicated rewards.","createdAt":1785115320805,"updatedAt":1785115320805},{"id":"wmf-thread-lackless","worldId":"ag5-SfCGAP0HIVKimJBe7","name":"The Lackless Mystery","color":"#92400e","description":"Meluan, the ancient box, and old rhymes deepen the mystery of Kvothe's maternal family.","createdAt":1785115320805,"updatedAt":1785115320805},{"id":"wmf-thread-bandits","worldId":"ag5-SfCGAP0HIVKimJBe7","name":"The Bandits in the Eld","color":"#166534","description":"The Maer's stolen taxes lead Kvothe to a hidden force commanded by Cinder.","createdAt":1785115320805,"updatedAt":1785115320805},{"id":"wmf-thread-fae","worldId":"ag5-SfCGAP0HIVKimJBe7","name":"Felurian and the Fae","color":"#9333ea","description":"Kvothe enters the Fae, earns a shaed, learns of the moon, and speaks to the Cthaeh.","createdAt":1785115320805,"updatedAt":1785115320805},{"id":"wmf-thread-lethani","worldId":"ag5-SfCGAP0HIVKimJBe7","name":"The Lethani","color":"#0f766e","description":"Tempi and the Adem train Kvothe in disciplined action, language, and restraint.","createdAt":1785115320805,"updatedAt":1785115320805},{"id":"wmf-thread-legend","worldId":"ag5-SfCGAP0HIVKimJBe7","name":"Kvothe's Growing Legend","color":"#d97706","description":"Every success adds to Kvothe's reputation while widening the distance between the legend and Kote.","createdAt":1785115320805,"updatedAt":1785115320805},{"id":"wmf-thread-frame","worldId":"ag5-SfCGAP0HIVKimJBe7","name":"The Man Waiting to Die","color":"#475569","description":"At the Waystone, Bast and Chronicler struggle to recover the man hidden inside Kote.","createdAt":1785115320805,"updatedAt":1785115320805}],"motifs":[],"continuitySuppressions":[],"writingLogs":[],"sceneRevisions":[]}